  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Vallambhotla Siva Prasad Rao vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 12 December, 2022 Author: R. Raghunandan Rao Bench: R. Raghunandan Rao Hon'Ble Sri Justice R. Raghunandan Rao Criminal Petition No.9896 of 2022 Order:",
    "facts": "The petitioner is Accused in Crime No.92 of 2021 of Amaravathi Police Station, Guntur District, for offences under Sections 7(1), 20(2) of Cigarettes and other Tobacco Products Act on the ground that the petitioner was caught storing tobacco and tobacco products. After investigation, the police have filed a charge sheet before the II Additional Junior Civil Judge, Sattenapalli, who took cognizance of the case in C.C.No.177 of 2021.",
